        "original_id": "493350e8-65b0-574e-ac06-d7fcdb5814e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kalyanji Virji Shah, Anandji Virji Shah\n- Projects: Kalyanji–Anandji\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Music Director\n- Topics: discography, Bollywood film music\n\nFacts:\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah was born on 30 June 1928 and died on 3 November 2000.\n- Anandji Virji Shah was born on 2 March 1933.\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah and his brother Anandji Virji Shah were an Indian composer duo from Gujarat called Kalyanji–Anandji.\n- Kalyanji–Anandji were a Bollywood composer duo, and their discography is the discography of that duo.\n- In 1975, Anandji Virji Shah and his brother won the Filmfare Award for Best Music Director for Kora Kagaz.",
